{"duration": 28.43, "timeline": [[0.0, "What happens when you knock down a basement wall during a home renovation in 1963 and accidentally stumble into an 18-floor underground city?"], [8.13, "People think it's hidden treasure."], [10.37, "Others claim it was bunker."], [12.33, "It is a Byzantine refuge."], [14.5, "Christians carved it for safety."], [16.47, "Eighty‑five metres, eighteen floors deep."], [19.43, "Sheltered twenty thousand people together."], [21.87, "Vent shafts kept air moving."], [24.0, "Wall crumbled, hidden door opened."], [26.2, "Thus a wall opened city."]]}